inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".valid"},{"text":" padding","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": output is ","type":"text"},{"code":"(rows: (H−kH)\/strideR+1, columns: (W−kW)\/strideC+1, depth: D)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Gradient-computation","text":"Gradient computation","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During backpropagation each filter gradient and input gradient is computed independently per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"channel using full convolution of the upstream gradient with the flipped filter kernel. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the backward pass embarrassingly parallel across channels."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/DepthwiseConv2d","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/BaseConvolutionalLayer"],"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships"},{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/ConvolutionalLayer","doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/Layer","doc:\/\/Neuron\/Se","doc:\/\/Neuron\/SE"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Neuron15DepthwiseConv2dC","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DepthwiseConv2d","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DepthwiseConv2d"}],"symbolKind":"class","title":"DepthwiseConv2d","modules":[{"name":"Neuron"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/neuron\/depthwiseconv2d"]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/DepthwiseConv2d\/init(from:)","doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/DepthwiseConv2d\/init(inpu